---
import promotions from '../data/promotions.json';
import site from '../data/site.json';

const combo = promotions.combo;
---

<section class="py-20 bg-gray-50 text-gray-900 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-gray-200" id="combo-promocion">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest font-['Teko',sans-serif] mb-3">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
        {combo.badge}
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight font-['Teko',sans-serif] leading-none text-gray-900">
        BENEFICIOS POR TU COMPRA
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-base md:text-lg font-bold mt-2">
        Estimado Cliente, por la compra de su unidad, se le incluyen estos beneficios:
      </p>
      <div class="mt-3 inline-block bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-300 text-emerald-800 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs md:text-sm font-bold shadow-sm">
        🏅 Garantía por 1 año o 12,000 KM, lo que suceda primero (Sólo Motor)
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Card in Pure White -->
    <div class="relative bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-xl overflow-hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <!-- Visual Presentation -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 relative flex items-center justify-center min-h-[340px] md:min-h-[420px] bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50 to-gray-100/60 rounded-2xl p-4">
          <img
            src="/images/bikes/todoterreno-200-zz.png"
            alt="Nexus 200 ZZ Combo Motero"
            class="relative z-10 max-h-72 md:max-h-84 w-auto object-contain drop-shadow-[0_16px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] transform hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
          />

          <!-- Floating badge: Casco -->
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-2 md:left-6 z-20 bg-white border border-amber-300 rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-lg flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 font-bold">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-amber-700 block tracking-wider">Incluido Gratis</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase text-gray-900 font-['Teko',sans-serif] tracking-wide text-sm">CASCO PROTECTOR</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Floating badge: Placa SUNARP -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-2 md:right-6 z-20 bg-white border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-lg flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="bg-blue-50 text-gray-900 border-2 border-blue-600 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-center font-mono font-black text-xs">
              <span class="text-[7px] text-blue-700 block tracking-widest font-sans font-bold -mb-1">PERÚ</span>
              7890-NX
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-blue-600 block tracking-wider">Demora máx. 15-20 días</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase text-gray-900 font-['Teko',sans-serif] tracking-wide text-sm">TARJETA Y PLACA</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="absolute -bottom-2 left-6 z-20 bg-white border border-emerald-300 rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 shadow-md">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700">🛠️ 03 primeros Mantenimientos GRATIS (mano de obra) 😉</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Combo Details List -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black uppercase text-gray-900 font-['Teko',sans-serif] tracking-wide border-b border-gray-200 pb-2">
            Beneficios Incluidos por tu Compra
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            {combo.items.map((item) => (
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-emerald-50/40 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 transition-colors">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-1">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">{item.name}</h4>
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200">
                      {item.value}
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                    {item.description}
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 bg-amber-50/90 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl text-xs text-amber-950 font-medium space-y-1.5 shadow-sm">
            <p>📍 <strong>Trámite de Placa y Tarjeta:</strong> Demora máxima de 15 a 20 días hábiles.</p>
            <p>🛠️ <strong>Mantenimientos:</strong> Los 03 primeros Mantenimientos son GRATIS (mano de obra) 😉</p>
            <p>🏅 <strong>Garantía:</strong> Por 1 año o 12,000KM, lo que suceda primero. (Sólo Motor)</p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a
              href={`https://wa.me/${site.whatsappNumber}?text=Hola%20Grupo%20Lauzher,%20deseo%20consultar%20por%20los%20beneficios%20incluidos%20por%20la%20compra%20de%20mi%20moto`}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="flex-1 text-center py-3.5 px-6 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 shadow-md shadow-emerald-600/20 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
            >
              Consultar Beneficios por WhatsApp
            </a>
            <a
              href="/combos-promociones"
              class="py-3.5 px-6 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-700 border border-gray-300 hover:border-black hover:text-black transition-all text-center"
            >
              Ver Detalle Completo
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 pt-1">
            {combo.terms}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
